# Generative Art

Route `/generative-art`. Logic stays in `components/generative/`. Read Project 01 in @cyber_playground_roadmap.md.

- Fullscreen canvas, double-buffered, locked at 60 FPS.
- Floating glass deck with live controls for rotation velocity, noise scale, and the color gradient cycle.
- Presets switch the mathematical model on the same route.
- Snapshot exports the current frame as a PNG.
- Drawing stays on canvas. This experience does not synthesize audio.
